    {
      "id": "e04",
      "type": "reading",
      "title": "Yesterday",
      "lines": [
        {
          "bn": "গতকাল আমি সকাল সাতটায় উঠলাম।",
          "tr": "gotokal ami shokal shattay uthlam.",
          "en": "Yesterday I got up at seven in the morning."
        },
        {
          "bn": "তারপর আমি বন্ধুর সাথে বাজারে গেলাম।",
          "tr": "tarpor ami bondhur shathe bajare gelam.",
          "en": "Then I went to the market with a friend."
        },
        {
          "bn": "আমরা যখন বাজারে গেলাম, তখন দোকান বন্ধ ছিল।",
          "tr": "amra jokhon bajare gelam, tokhon dokan bondho chhilo.",
          "en": "When we got to the market, the shop was closed."
        },
        {
          "bn": "তাই আমরা রিকশায় বাসায় এলাম।",
          "tr": "tai amra rikshay bashay elam.",
          "en": "So we came home by rickshaw."
        },
        {
          "bn": "আম্মু রান্না করলেন, আর আমরা ভাত আর মাছ খেলাম।",
          "tr": "ammu ranna korlen, ar amra bhat ar machh khelam.",
          "en": "Mom cooked, and we ate rice and fish."
        },
        {
          "bn": "দিনটা খুব ভালো ছিল।",
          "tr": "dinta khub bhalo chhilo.",
          "en": "The day was very good."
        }
      ],
      "question": "Why did they come home?",
      "options": [
        "They were hungry",
        "It was night",
        "The shop was closed"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "why": "**দোকান বন্ধ ছিল**, **তাই** … বাসায় এলাম: তাই = so."
    },
